                    from each image with a frozen                               
                    pretrained ResNet-18, then train a                          
                    class-balanced logistic regression on                       
                    those features to predict malignant vs                      
                    non-malignant. We split the data                            
                    stratified by malignancy into train                         
                    and validation sets, extract features                       
                    via DataLoader, and fit the                                 
                    classifier. We evaluate performance                         
                    with AUROC on the validation set and                        
                    save both the encoder and classifier.                       
                    A predict(folder_path) function loads                       
                    these models, extracts features for                         
                    new images, and returns malignancy                          
