                    The updated validation loop reshapes                        
                    the batched crops, runs them through                        
                    the model, applies sigmoid, reshapes                        
                    back to per‐image predictions, and                          
                    averages them. The `predict` function                       
                    is also updated to use TenCrop TTA for                      
                    inference.                                                  
