                    Design: We will incorporate a                               
                    WeightedRandomSampler in the training                       
                    DataLoader to address class imbalance                       
                    by oversampling malignant cases. We'll                      
                    compute sample weights as the inverse                       
                    frequency of each class, then use the                       
                    sampler to yield balanced batches                           
                    during training. This simple change                         
                    aims to improve the model's sensitivity                     
                    to the minority class and overall                           
                    AUROC. All other aspects of the                             
                    pipeline, including data augmentations,                     
                    model architecture, training epochs,                        
                    and TTA inference, remain the same.                         
