                    Design: I propose to improve                                
                    generalization by replacing the Adam                        
                    optimizer with AdamW (adding weight                         
                    decay) and introducing a Cosine                             
                    Annealing learning‐rate scheduler over                      
                    the 5 training epochs. This regularizes                     
                    the model and smoothly decays the                           
                    learning rate, often boosting                               
                    validation AUROC without other changes.                     
                    The rest of the training and TTA                            
                    inference pipeline remains unchanged.                       
